PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0

  >>> THIS FILE IS A PLACEHOLDER. REPLACE IT BEFORE MAKING THE REPO PUBLIC. <<<

  Get the official text from:
      https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0

  Copy it in full and overwrite this file, keeping the filename LICENSE.
  Do not edit the licence text. GitHub identifies a licence by matching it
  against the canonical wording, and any change means it will show as
  "unlicensed" instead — and, more importantly, a modified licence is a
  different licence.

  The fan-content disclaimer belongs in NOTICE.md, not in here, for the
  same reason.

In summary, once the real text is in place:

  Licensor:  Mejdy Nienhuis
  Permitted: any noncommercial use — personal use, use at your own table,
             use by a group of friends, research, teaching, modification
             and sharing of modified versions.
  Reserved:  commercial use of any kind, which remains the licensor's alone.

